1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I sit alone beside the floor.

2
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Too few girls and left behind.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,800
An awkward boy without a match,

4
00:00:16,949 --> 00:00:20,449
With sweating palms and frozen mind.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Tonight I'll be your partner, Paul,

6
00:00:25,149 --> 00:00:28,649
Ginger's low warm voice cuts through the room.

7
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:31,300
Long dark hair and dark deep eyes,

8
00:00:31,449 --> 00:00:33,950
She pulls me from my quiet gloom.

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,500
My inner fuses all burn out.

10
00:00:38,649 --> 00:00:41,149
Ice water shoots through every vein.

11
00:00:41,299 --> 00:00:43,799
I step so stiff, I treat her wrong,

12
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:46,950
Drowned in a haze of fear and pain.

13
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,500
I mess up every single step,

14
00:00:50,649 --> 00:00:53,149
Afraid to touch, afraid to lead.

15
00:00:53,299 --> 00:00:55,799
She turns into a lifeless doll,

16
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,950
And leaves me here alone to bleed.

17
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
I broke her trust, I failed the test.

18
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:08,650
I stumble on the wooden floor.

19
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:11,299
She steps away toward the bar,

20
00:01:11,450 --> 00:01:13,950
And turns her back forevermore.

21
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,500
I watch her walk toward the post.

22
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:21,650
Ginger leaves me in this frozen space.

23
00:01:21,799 --> 00:01:24,299
I lost my chance, I lost the fire...

24
00:01:24,450 --> 00:01:27,450
A shattered ghost without a trace.

25
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:29,599
You see I am to little,

26
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:34,500
the duckling from that tale.

27
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,799
Not good enough,

28
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:39,750
Not worth it.